00:38:49,840 --> 00:40:19,600
So I want to ask a question kind of on that unique paragraph as well, but there seems to be a growing also concern that AI and its capabilities are also uniquely positioned to be harnessed by by autocracies and that it's you know democracy has a unique vulnerability and i'd like maybe if each of you could speak a little bit to that and if those fears are are justified and what people are doing about that what what you guys see being done Devin if I maybe can turn to you first sure I'm not the happy fun guy when it comes to this stuff because I've had too many conversations with folks in in defense and intel land that you know I get I'm a poor sleeper as a result the the Some years ago now that the developers in going to the to the to the party in pitching this technology.

